    "detailed_description": "This game is a battle royale strategy game that focuses on management and competition. The troops in the battlefield will fight automatically, so you don\u2019t need to pay attention to the battle operations. You need to focus all your energy on the construction of the territory, the deployment of the army, and Click to go out and see who can finally dominate the world in a completely real-time confrontation mode.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Managing one's own country </strong></h2>Building and upgrading various facilities in one's own territory<br>To win over various forces around the city for one's own use<br>Recruiting ronin scattered within the territory<br>Publish policies and research technology to enhance the combat effectiveness of the military<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Accumulate troops and continuously expand </strong></h2>Accumulate troops according to time and organize troops for vassals<br>Embark on expeditions to the surrounding weak and powerful families and eliminate them<br>Developing one's own strength through gradual expansion and utilizing the other party's retainers for personal use<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Be careful of the attacks of other players </strong></h2>Resist the attacks of all other players and occupy all the opponent's cities in a 60 minute round of the game<br>Every player is a hundred times stronger than AI, and you need to constantly face their attacks<br>Collaborate with allies to create a lottery game<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> A constantly recurring battle situation </strong></h2>Each game has random policy options, special facilities, various factions, and ronin spawning<br>Complete the battle and receive rewards<br>Draw generals cards to permanently increase their level and bring them into the next game",
    "about_the_game": "This game is a battle royale strategy game that focuses on management and competition. The troops in the battlefield will fight automatically, so you don\u2019t need to pay attention to the battle operations. You need to focus all your energy on the construction of the territory, the deployment of the army, and Click to go out and see who can finally dominate the world in a completely real-time confrontation mode.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Managing one's own country </strong></h2>Building and upgrading various facilities in one's own territory<br>To win over various forces around the city for one's own use<br>Recruiting ronin scattered within the territory<br>Publish policies and research technology to enhance the combat effectiveness of the military<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Accumulate troops and continuously expand </strong></h2>Accumulate troops according to time and organize troops for vassals<br>Embark on expeditions to the surrounding weak and powerful families and eliminate them<br>Developing one's own strength through gradual expansion and utilizing the other party's retainers for personal use<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> Be careful of the attacks of other players </strong></h2>Resist the attacks of all other players and occupy all the opponent's cities in a 60 minute round of the game<br>Every player is a hundred times stronger than AI, and you need to constantly face their attacks<br>Collaborate with allies to create a lottery game<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> A constantly recurring battle situation </strong></h2>Each game has random policy options, special facilities, various factions, and ronin spawning<br>Complete the battle and receive rewards<br>Draw generals cards to permanently increase their level and bring them into the next game",
